# The build context of Dockerfile.tinygo alone, the same widening
# Dockerfile.gotest.dockerignore makes for the gc gates: BuildKit reads a
# <dockerfile>.dockerignore in preference to the one at the repository root,
# so this leaves the root file's deny-all — which keeps the four image
# contexts down to install.sh — untouched.
#
# Nested re-inclusion needs every level spelled out: an exception cannot reach
# into a folder the line above excluded, so services/ is let back in before
# its children are filtered.
*
!go.work
!go.work.sum
!pkg
!tools
!tests
!services
services/*
!services/dispat

# The export folder of a release build: output rather than source.
services/dispat/dist

# What the dispat suite reads beyond its module: the installers and image
# folders the selfupdate tests hold to the CLI's asset names, and the
# architecture page the plan tests hold the diagnostic codes to.
!install.sh
!install.ps1
!docker
!packages
packages/*
!packages/docs
packages/docs/*
!packages/docs/docs
